flowchart TD
  A[Publish profile / Endpoint sync] --> B[Generate or reuse WIM.torrent + os-torrent.json]
  B --> C[Start HTTP / TFTP / DHCP]
  C --> D[Start Torrent tracker + seeder]
  D --> E[WinPE POST /osdcloud/boot-session]
  E --> F[Map SMB and validate selected WIM]
  F --> G{torrentEnabled + aria2 + metadata valid?}
  G -- No --> H[Keep SMB ImageFile]
  G -- Yes --> I[New-OSDisk + GET .torrent]
  I --> J[Start aria2 BitTorrent download]
  J --> K{Progress / timeout / SHA256 OK?}
  K -- No --> H
  K -- Yes --> L[Use local C:\\OSDCloud\\OS\\WIM]
  L --> M[Invoke-OSDCloud with SkipAllDiskSteps]
  H --> N[Invoke-OSDCloud with SMB-direct image]
  M --> O[Continue seeding during apply]
  O --> P[Seed wait / release / reboot]
  N --> Q[Reboot]
